+++ b/releasenotes/notes/oslo-service-threading-backend-5f0c1d7a3b9e4c28.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+other:
+  - |
+    Keystone now selects the ``threading`` oslo.service backend by default,
+    rather than ``eventlet``. Keystone does not use eventlet itself, so this
+    stops eventlet being imported into each keystone process, which saves
+    memory. A backend chosen explicitly through
+    ``oslo_service.backend.init_backend()`` is not affected.
